{"findings":[{"rule_id":"WPS-004","evidence":[{"kind":"dimension","ref":"D15","page":1,"quote":"⌀ 150 H7"},{"kind":"note","ref":"N3","page":1,"quote":"NOTE : (English) # MATERIAL: M.S. # FINISH: I.Z.B.P. (TRIVALENT) # MACHINING: 3.2 # WEIGHT(Kg ): 175.90 kg"}],"comment":"The ⌀150 H7 bore carries an ISO fit but no allowance is made for the I.Z.B.P. plating thickness specified in note N3, which will reduce the finished bore size and may prevent assembly with the mating shaft. The designer should add a pre-plating machining allowance or specify that the bore be re-machined after plating."

    ,
    "recommended_correction": "Add a pre-plating oversize allowance to D15 so the final plated bore remains within H7 limits, or add a note requiring the bore to be machined to size after plating."}]}
